{"version":1,"content":"<p>【AI 安全法 😱】外媒報道，AI 巨頭 Anthropic 近期正低調向美國國會遊說一項全新的「AI 安全法案」（AI Safety Bill）。</p><p>該提案設定了極為嚴苛的干預門檻，只有在 AI 模型面臨造成至少 50 人死傷，或帶來高達 10 億美元（約 78 億港元 / 320 億新台幣）以上的重大損失風險時，政府部門才有權出手叫停該模型的發布。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.594776+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:56:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:47.701996+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684399+00:00","content_hash":"635eb565048dbdd742dd5156c666b76ae96c16a2cb9fd2564079eefeb28e4418","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}